---
args: {"episodes": "AdministrativeEpisode[]", "associations": "JourneyAssociation[]", "prior": "AdministrativeMechanism[]"}
returns: "AdministrativeMechanism[]"
---
Group episodes by a plausible administrative process mechanism, preserving independent-experience counts and minority cases. For each hypothesis call seekDisconfirmingExperience(hypothesis, episodes, associations). Compare failed callbacks, unclear instructions, channel access and reporting changes as rival explanations where supported. Choose a next observation that distinguishes rivals. Correlation and repeated wording do not establish causality or clinical quality.
